WEBVTT

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.708
aynan lotin tiliga tarjima qilingach —

00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:02.758
ular yunon tilidagi 'kai' harfini

00:03:02.758 --> 00:03:04.791
oddiygina qilib lotin tilidagi

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:07.141
X harfiga almashtirishdi.

00:03:07.141 --> 00:03:08.410
Aynan shundan keyin

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.875
bu materialni lotin tilida chiqara 
boshlashdi,

00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:14.458
va bu matematika darsliklarining asosiga 
aylandi,

00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:16.541
keyingi 600 yil davomida.

00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:18.559
Endi biz savolimizga javob oldik.

00:03:18.559 --> 00:03:21.340
Nega X — bu noaniqlik?

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.163
X — noaniqlik ekanligini sababi shuki,

00:03:23.163 --> 00:03:26.945
ispan tilida "sh" tovushi mavjud emas.

00:03:26.945 --> 00:03:29.329
(Kulgu)

00:03:29.329 --> 00:03:31.646
Va men buni sizlarga ulashishga qaror 
qildim.